</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </table-wrap>
        <p>Abbreviation:&#x000a0;IOP, intraocular pressure.</p>
        <p>
<bold>Key Interprofessional Principle</bold>
</p>
        <p>Early recognition of complications and seamless communication among team members are the cornerstones of long-term success following artificial corneal transplantation.</p>
      </sec>
